            <div class="workspace-actions"><button type="button" id="sip-save-code" class="workspace-button">Remember this code on this device</button><button type="button" id="sip-clear-codes" class="workspace-button">Clear saved codes</button></div>
            <p id="sip-code-status" role="status">This code grants private access. It is saved only if you choose Remember.</p>
            <div class="sip-tracking-footer-tip">
