     <p class="staff-board-safety">Move opens a review form; nothing changes until you save. Needs review and Declined submissions are now in <a href="/admin/reviews">Review ideas</a>. Existing links and idea IDs still work.</p>
     <details class="staff-board-help"><summary>Board controls and recovery</summary><p>Use Move on a selected card to review the selected group with a keyboard, or drag a selected card with a pointer. Scroll within a column to load its next batch. Each column keeps up to 72 cards in the current window; use pagination to continue beyond it. Each stage pages independently. Selection can include other pages and is kept only during this visit. Drag a selected card to review moves for the selected group, one idea at a time. A destination must support every selected idea. Dragging an unselected card moves only that idea.</p><p>Assignments save together: if any selected version changed, none are saved. After a timeout, refresh to confirm before retrying. Published history is corrected with a new update; merges require an operator to review the audit for recovery.</p></details>
