          <label class="workspace-field-label" for="staff-progress-date">When did this happen?</label><input type="date" id="staff-progress-date" class="workspace-input" required aria-describedby="staff-progress-date-hint"/><p id="staff-progress-date-hint" class="workspace-field-hint">Today by default. You may backdate up to 14 days; the posting date remains visible.</p>
